This is a black-box assertion (never Saturday/Sunday); it does not actually exercise the holiday branch. Supporting helpers (`structuredOwner`, `createOwnerOk`, `fetchOwner`, `HOLIDAYS`, test-side `toBusinessDay`) are all in `AcceptanceBase.java`. No unit test directly targets the private `toBusinessDay`/`resolveRegistrationDate` methods.

